Hello,

Here is a small update to correct various bugs that you reported to us:

Some texts have been corrected;
The pagination of the global ranking is functional;
The Saturday Event Quest now displays correctly;
Discord buttons now use the correct link;
The tactical asset should be the correct color in the action summary.


Small reminder that every Saturday an event quest is active! Earn 10 Krystal Coins for every 3 wins.
